  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FN fond f&#xf6;r kvinnors ekonomiska egenmakt</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Programme on Gender Equality and Women&apos;s    Empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet syftar till att st&#xf6;dja fyra outputomr&#xe5;den f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;ka      j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldheten och s&#xe4;rskilt kvinnors ekonomiska egenmakt i Etiopien.  Genom UN One Fund &#xf6;ronm&#xe4;rks st&#xf6;det till det samlade FN-programmet och d&#xe4;r fyra FN-organisationer har co-lead ansvar f&#xf6;r respektive          outputomr&#xe5;de.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Gender Joint Programme aims to support four output areas in order to increase gender equality and women&apos;s economic empowerment in       Ethiopia. The support is channelled through the UN One Fund and       earmarked to the Gender Joint Programme where four UN-agencies have a co-lead responsibility for each output area.</narrative>
  </description>
